# Found colonies on Tupi (peace) land: Build Colony asks nothing and charges nothing (the native-land prompt
# lives on the colony-screen plot drop, colony_tile_native_land). Fixture: Peter Minuit removed from France
# (FF 2), gold 1500; three colonists (128..130), full moves, on coastal forest next to Tupi villages, selected
# in id order (every other French unit sentried so none auto-cycles in first).
# Tiles (45,22) beside village (46,22), (47,25) and (45,27) beside village (46,26).
key b                      # colonist at (45,22): name prompt at once, no @INDIANLAND
key Return                 # name prompt (default): colony founded, colony screen opens
key Escape                 # back to the map; next colonist selected
key b                      # colonist at (47,25)
key Return
key Escape
key b                      # colonist at (45,27)
key Return
key Escape
